sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS is configured to first respond to a<br>BootNotificationRequest with status Pending or Rejected
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = PowerUp,<br>chargingStation.model = <Configured model>,<br>chargingStation.vendorName = <Configured vendorName>)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Pending OR Rejected)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Pending OR Rejected

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = BootNotification)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be BootNotification
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = Triggered,<br>chargingStation.model = <Configured model>,<br>chargingStation.vendorName = <Configured vendorName>)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    alt StatusNotificationRequest
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else NotifyEventRequest
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available",<br>component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
